  "$comment": "Product screenshots (60.09), read by scripts/shots.mjs. widths: the srcset sizes per app (60.01 part B sets them; change them here). crop: pixels cut from each edge of the capture before resizing (the frame's safe area). artifact: the CI artifact a run uploads the app's PNGs in; repo: where they are committed instead (Roborazzi references). job: a part of the CI job's name that made them, so a red job keeps the previous images.",
